stanzas.text:
Yeye anaye sifa, ni
Yesu
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Ndiye aliye mnyenyekevu
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Yesu ajua……

Yesu pamoja nasi daima,
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Kwa usiku aleta salama,
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Yesu ajua……

Kulinda Yesu yu
Mwaminifu,
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Atawakubali wahalifu,
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Yesu ajua…..

Alipelekwa awe mwokozi,
Yu pekee, yu peee;
Anatutayarisha enzi
Yu pekee, yu pekee;
Yesu ajua…….
